hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak aamaal niyaton key sath hain, aur beshak har shakhs key liye wahi hai jo us ne niyat ki. Phir jiski hijrat duniya ki taraf ho jisey wo paeyga ya aurat ki taraf ho jis se wo nikaah karega, to uski hijrat usi ki taraf hai jiski taraf us ne hijrat ki. (Bukhari: 1)"
"2","[AI-translation] Aisha Ummul Momineen (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Haris bin Hishaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha, unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap key paas wahi kaisey aati hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kabhi merey paas ghanti ki jhankaar ki maanind aati hai, aur ye mujh par sab se sakht hoti hai, phir mujh se juda hoti hai jabke main ne us se jo us ne kaha yaad kar liya hota hai, aur kabhi farishta merey liye aadmi ki soorat mein zaahir hota hai phir mujh se kalaam karta hai to main jo wo kehta hai yaad kar leta hun. Aisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha: Aur beshak main ne Aap ko sakht sardi key din wahi naazil hotey huey dekha, phir Aap se (wo kefiyat) juda hoti aur beshak Aap ki peshaani paseeney se beh rahi hoti. (Bukhari: 2)"
"3","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahi ki ibteda neend mein sacchey khwaabon se hui. Aap jo khwaab dekhtey wo subah ki roshni ki tarah zaahir ho jaata. Phir Aap ki taraf tanhai ki mohabbat daal di gai, aur Aap Ghaar-e-Hira mein tanha rehtey, us mein kai-kai raaton ibaadat kartey, apne ghar walon ki taraf lautney se pehley, aur uskey liye tosha ley jaatey, phir Khadija key paas wapas aatey aur isi tarah (agli martaba) key liye tosha leytey, yahan tak ke Aap key paas haq aa gaya jabke Aap Ghaar-e-Hira mein they. To Aap key paas farishta aaya aur us ne kaha: Padhiye! Aap ne kaha: Main padhney wala nahi hun. Aap ne farmaya: To us ne mujhey pakda aur mujhey bhinch daala yahan tak ke mujh se sakht mehnat (aur takleef) pahunchi, phir mujhey chhor diya aur kaha: Padhiye! Main ne kaha: Main padhney wala nahi hun. To us ne mujhey pakda aur doosri baar mujhey bhinch daala yahan tak ke mujh se sakht takleef pahunchi, phir mujhey chhor diya aur kaha: Padhiye! To main ne kaha: Main padhney wala nahi hun. To us ne mujhey pakda aur teesri baar mujhey bhinch daala, phir mujhey chhor diya aur kaha: (Apne Rab key naam se padhiye jis ne paida kya, insaan ko jamey huey khoon se paida kya. Padhiye aur Aap ka Rab sab se buzurg hai). To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey ley kar wapas aey jabke Aap ka dil kaanp raha tha. To Aap Khadija bint Khuwailid (Raziallahu anha) key paas daakhil huey aur farmaya: Mujhey kambal odha do, mujhey kambal odha do! To unhon-ne Aap ko kambal odha diya yahan tak ke Aap se ghabrahat door ho gai. To Aap ne Khadija se kaha aur unhey khabar sunaai: Beshak mujhey apni jaan ka khauf hua. To Khadija ne kaha: Hargiz nahi, Allah ki qasam! Allah Aap ko kabhi ruswa nahi karega. Beshak Aap sila rehmi kartey hain, aur naatawan ka bojh uthaatey hain, aur nadaar ko kama kar detey hain, aur mehmaan ki mehmaan nawaazi kartey hain, aur haq ki musibaton mein madad kartey hain. Phir Khadija Aap ko ley kar chalein yahan tak ke Aap ko Waraqa bin Naufal bin Asad bin Abdul Uzza key paas laaein jo Khadija key chacha zaad bhai they. Aur wo aisey shakhs they jo zamaana-e-jaahiliyat mein Nasraani ho gaey they, aur Ibraani kitaab likhtey they, to Injeel mein se jo Allah chahta likhtey, aur wo bahut budhey they aur naabeena ho chukey they. To Khadija ne un se kaha: Ae merey chacha zaad bhai! Apne bhatijey se suniye. To Waraqa ne Aap se kaha: Ae merey bhatijey! Tum kya dekhtey ho? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey jo dekha tha uski khabar sunaai. To Waraqa ne un se kaha: Ye wahi Naamoos hai jo Allah ne Musa par naazil kya tha. Kaash main us waqt jawaan hota, kaash main zinda hota jab tumhari qaum tumhey nikaalegi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya wo mujhey nikaalenge? Us ne kaha: Haan, jo shakhs bhi isi tarah laaya jo tum laey ho magar us se dushmani ki gai, aur agar tumhara din mujhey mil gaya to main tumhari poori madad karunga. Phir zyada der na guzri ke Waraqa faut ho gaey aur wahi ka silsila ruk gaya. (Bukhari: 3)"
"4","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, aur wo wahi key fatrat (waqfa) key baarey mein bayan kar rahey they, to unhon-ne apni hadees mein kaha: Main chal raha tha ke main ne aasmaan se aik aawaaz suni, to main ne aasmaan ki taraf apni nigaah uthaai to wo farishta jo merey paas Hira mein aaya tha aasmaan aur zameen key darmiyaan aik kursi par baitha hua tha. To main us se dar gaya, phir main apne ghar walon key paas aaya aur main ne kaha: Mujhey kambal odha do, mujhey kambal odha do! To Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Ae kambal odhney waley! Khadey ho jaaiye aur daraaiye) uskey qaul (aur gandagi se door rahiye) tak. To wahi tez ho gai aur lagataar aaney lagi. (Bukhari: 4). Aur Jabir bin Abdullah Ansaari (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo wahi key fatrat key baarey mein bayan kar rahey they, to unhon-ne apni hadees mein kaha: Main chal raha tha ke main ne aasmaan se aik aawaaz suni, to main ne apni nigaah uthaai to wo farishta jo merey paas Hira mein aaya tha aasmaan aur zameen key darmiyaan kursi par baitha hua tha. To main us se dar gaya, phir main wapas aaya aur main ne kaha: Mujhey kambal odha do, mujhey kambal odha do! To Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Ae kambal odhney waley! Khadey ho jaaiye aur daraaiye) uskey qaul (aur gandagi se door rahiye) tak. To wahi tez ho gai aur lagataar aaney lagi. (4). Aur Surah Muddassir ki tafseer mein iski doosri riwayaat bhi musnad aur muttasil hain, to Zabidi ne un sab ko chhor diya. Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"5","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Allah Taala key qaul (Apni zabaan ko uskey sath harkat na dijiye taake Aap us mein jaldi karein) key baarey mein riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) naazil honay (wahi) se sakhti jheltey they, aur un mein se tha ke Aap apne honthon ko harkat detey they. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: To main un donon ko tumharey liye harkat deta hun jaisey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhey harkat detey they. To Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Apni zabaan ko uskey sath harkat na dijiye taake Aap us mein jaldi karein. Beshak uska jama karna aur uska padhana Hamaarey zimmey hai). Unhon-ne kaha: Uska jama karna Aap key seeney mein aur Aap ka usey padhna. (Phir jab Ham usey padhein to Aap uskey padhney ki pairwi kijiye). Unhon-ne kaha: To usey ghaur se suniye aur khaamosh rahiye. (Phir beshak uska bayaan karna Hamaarey zimmey hai). Phir beshak Hamaarey zimmey hai ke Aap usey padhein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uskey baad jab Aap key paas Jibreel aatey to ghaur se suntey, phir jab Jibreel chaley jaatey to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey padhtey jaisey Jibreel ne usey padha tha. (Bukhari: 5)"
"6","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein sab se zyada sakhi they, aur Ramazan mein sab se zyada sakhi hotey jab Aap se Jibreel miltey. Aur wo Ramazan ki har raat mein Aap se miltey aur Aap se Quran ka daur kartey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhalai mein bheji hui hawa se bhi tez they. (Bukhari: 6)"
"7","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke Abu Sufyan bin Harb ne unhey khabar di ke Hiraql ne unhey Quraish key aik qaailey mein bulwa bheja, aur wo Shaam mein tijaarat kar rahey they, us muddat mein jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Sufyan aur kuffaar-e-Quraish se sulah ki hui thi. To wo uskey paas aey jabke wo Iliya (Bait-ul-Muqaddas) mein they. To us ne unhey bulaaya jabke uskey gird Room key bade aadmi they, phir us ne unhey bulaaya aur apne tarjumaan ko bulaaya aur kaha: Tum mein se is shakhs se jo nabuwwat ka daawa karta hai nasab mein zyada qareeb kaun hai? To Abu Sufyan ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Nasab mein un mein sab se zyada qareeb main hun. To us ne kaha: Usey merey qareeb kar do aur uskey saathiyon ko qareeb karo, unhey uski peeth key peechey kar do. Phir us ne apne tarjumaan se kaha: Un se kaho ke main is shakhs se is aadmi key baarey mein poochhney wala hun, phir agar wo mujh se jhoot boley to tum usey jhutla dena. To Allah ki qasam! Agar mujhey is baat se sharam na aati ke wo mujh par jhoot ka ilzaam lagaengey to main uskey baarey mein jhoot bolta. Phir sab se pehla sawaal jo us ne mujh se kya wo ye tha ke us ne kaha: Tum mein uska nasab kaisa hai? Main ne kaha: Wo ham mein nasab wala hai. Us ne kaha: To kya tum mein se kisi ne is se pehley ye baat kahi hai? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Us ne kaha: To kya uskey baap daada mein se koi baadshah tha? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Us ne kaha: To bade logon ne uski pairwi ki ya kamzoron ne? To main ne kaha: Balke kamzoron ne. Us ne kaha: Kya wo badhtey hain ya ghat-tey hain? Main ne kaha: Balke badhtey hain. Us ne kaha: To kya un mein se koi shakhs apne deen se naaraaz ho kar us mein daakhil honay key baad phirta hai? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Us ne kaha: To kya tum jo us ne kaha us se pehley us par jhoot ka ilzaam lagaatey they? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Us ne kaha: To kya wo dhoka deta hai? Main ne kaha: Nahi, aur ham us se aik muddat (sulah) mein hain, ham nahi jaantey ke wo us mein kya karney wala hai. Us ne kaha: Aur mujhey aik kalimat key siwa koi kalimat na mil saka jis mein main kuchh daakhil karun. Us ne kaha: To kya tum ne us se jang ki? Main ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: To us se tumhari jang kaisi rahi? Main ne kaha: Hamaarey aur uskey darmiyaan jang daolon wali hai, wo ham se paata hai aur ham us se paatey hain. Us ne kaha: Wo tumhey kya hukm deta hai? Main ne kaha: Wo kehta hai: Allah ki ibaadat karo, Akeley ki, aur uskey sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karo, aur jo tumharey baap daada kehtey hain usey chhor do. Aur wo hamein namaz aur zakat aur sachaai aur paakdaamani aur sila rehmi ka hukm deta hai. To us ne tarjumaan se kaha: Us se kaho: Main ne tum se uskey nasab key baarey mein poochha to tum ne zikr kya ke wo tum mein nasab wala hai, to isi tarah Rasool apni qaum key nasab mein bhejey jaatey hain. Aur main ne tum se poochha: Kya tum mein se kisi ne ye baat kahi? To tum ne zikr kya ke nahi. To main ne kaha: Agar kisi ne is se pehley ye baat kahi hoti to main kehta: Aik aadmi jo baat is se pehley kahi gai uski pairwi karta hai. Aur main ne tum se poochha: Kya uskey baap daada mein se koi baadshah tha? To tum ne zikr kya ke nahi. Main ne kaha: To agar uskey baap daada mein se koi baadshah hota to main kehta: Aik aadmi jo apne baap ki baadshahat chahta hai. Aur main ne tum se poochha: Kya tum jo us ne kaha us se pehley us par jhoot ka ilzaam lagaatey they? To tum ne zikr kya ke nahi. To main jaan gaya hun ke wo aisa na tha ke logon par jhoot chhorey aur Allah par jhoot boley. Aur main ne tum se poochha: Bade logon ne uski pairwi ki ya kamzoron ne? To tum ne zikr kya ke kamzoron ne uski pairwi ki, aur wahi Rasoolon key pairwkaar hain. Aur main ne tum se poochha: Kya wo badhtey hain ya ghat-tey hain? To tum ne zikr kya ke wo badhtey hain, aur isi tarah imaan ka maamla hai yahan tak ke poora ho jaata hai. Aur main ne tum se poochha: Kya koi apne deen se naaraaz ho kar us mein daakhil honay key baad phirta hai? To tum ne zikr kya ke nahi, aur isi tarah imaan hai jab uski thandak dilon mein sama jaati hai. Aur main ne tum se poochha: Kya wo dhoka deta hai? To tum ne zikr kya ke nahi, aur isi tarah Rasool dhoka nahi detey. Aur main ne tum se poochha: Wo tumhey kis ka hukm deta hai? To tum ne zikr kya ke wo tumhey hukm deta hai ke Allah ki ibaadat karo, Akeley ki, aur uskey sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karo, aur tumhey buton ki ibaadat se rokta hai, aur tumhey namaz aur sachaai aur paakdaamani ka hukm deta hai. Phir agar jo tum kehtey ho sach hai to wo anqareeb merey in donon qadmon ki jagah ka maalik ho jaeyga. Aur beshak main jaanta tha ke wo nikalney wala hai, main ye gumaan na karta tha ke wo tum mein se hoga. Phir agar main jaan lun ke main us tak pahunch sakta hun to us se milney ki takleef uthaun, aur agar main uskey paas hota to uskey qadam dho deta. Phir us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khat manga jo Aap ne Dihya key haath Busra key bade aadmi ko bhej kar Hiraql ko dilwaaya tha. To us ne usey padha to us mein tha: Allah key naam se jo bada Meherbaan Nihayat Rehem wala hai. Muhammad Abdullah key bandey aur uskey Rasool ki taraf se, Hiraql Room key bade ki taraf. Salaam ho us par jo hidaayat ki pairwi karey. Amma baad! Phir beshak main tumhey Islam ki daawat deta hun. Musalman ho jao, salaamat rahogey, Allah tumhey tumhara ajr do martaba dega. Phir agar tum ne munh moda to beshak tum par Arisiyon ka gunaah hai. Aur (Ae Ahle Kitaab! Aao aik aisi baat ki taraf jo hamaarey aur tumharey darmiyaan baraabar hai ke ham Allah key siwa kisi ki ibaadat na karein aur uskey sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karein aur ham mein se koi kisi ko Allah key siwa Rab na banaey. Phir agar wo munh modein to kaho: Gawaah raho ke ham Musalman hain). Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Phir jab us ne jo kaha kaha aur khat padh kar faarigh hua to uskey paas shor bahut ho gaya aur aawaazein buland huin, aur hamein nikaal diya gaya. To main ne apne saathiyon se kaha jab hamein nikaal diya gaya: Beshak Ibn Abi Kabsha ka maamla bada ho gaya hai ke us se Room key baadshah dartey hain. To main mutmaen raha ke wo ghaalib aaeyga yahan tak ke Allah ne mujh par Islam daakhil kar diya. Aur Ibn Naatur Iliya ka rehne wala aur Hiraql ka, Shaam key Nasraniyon par padri tha, bayan karta hai ke Hiraql jab Iliya aaya to aik din subah uska dil kharaab tha. To uskey kuchh sardaaron ne kaha: Ham ne tumhari haalat naagawaar paai hai. Ibn Naatur ne kaha: Aur Hiraql nujoomi tha, sitaaron mein dekhta tha. To us ne un se kaha jab unhon-ne us se poochha: Beshak main ne raat ko jab main ne sitaaron mein dekha to khatna walon ka baadshah zaahir ho chuka hai. To is ummat mein se khatna kaun karta hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Yahoodiyon key siwa koi khatna nahi karta, to unka maamla tumhey fikr mein na daaley, aur apni saltanat key shehron ko likho ke wo un mein jo Yahoodi hain unhey qatl kar dein. To jabke wo apne maamley mein they ke Hiraql key paas aik aadmi laaya gaya jisey Ghassaan key baadshah ne bheja tha, jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khabar sunaata tha. Phir jab Hiraql ne us se poochha to us ne kaha: Jao aur dekho ke kya wo khatna shuda hai ya nahi. To unhon-ne usey dekha aur usey khabar di ke wo khatna shuda hai. Aur us ne us se Arbon key baarey mein poochha to us ne kaha: Wo khatna kartey hain. To Hiraql ne kaha: Is ummat ki baadshahat zaahir ho chuki hai. Phir Hiraql ne Rumiya mein apne aik dost ko likha, aur wo ilm mein uskey baraabar tha. Aur Hiraql Hims ki taraf chala, phir Hims se na hata yahan tak ke uskey dost ka khat uskey paas aa gaya jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key nikalney par Hiraql ki raey key muwaafiq tha, aur ke wo Nabi hain. To Hiraql ne Room key badon ko Hims mein apne aik mehal mein ijazat di, phir uskey darwaazon key baarey mein hukm diya to wo band kar diye gaey. Phir us ne jhaanka aur kaha: Ae Room ki jamaat! Kya tumharey liye falaah aur bhalai mein (raghbat) hai, aur ke tumhari baadshahat qaaem rahey, to tum is Nabi ki baiat kar lo. To wo jangli gadhey ki tarah darwaazon ki taraf bhaagey, to unhey paaya ke wo band kar diye gaey they. Phir jab Hiraql ne unki nafrat dekhi aur imaan se naaumeed hua to kaha: Unhey merey paas wapas lao. Aur kaha: Beshak main ne jo baat abhi kahi us se tumharey apne deen par sakhti ko aazmaana chaaha tha, to main ne dekh liya. To unhon-ne usey sajda kya aur us se raazi ho gaey. To ye Hiraql ka aakhri maamla tha. (Bukhari: 7). Kitab-ul-Imaan."
